feat(warehouse): multi-location vendor warehouse routing

Add Vendor Warehouse child table on Vendor doctype — each warehouse
carries lat/lng for nearest-distance routing and maps to an ERPNext
Warehouse on the vendor's site. Vendor Stock gains a warehouse dimension
(is_default_warehouse flag for backward compat with existing rows).

New warehouses.py API: get_warehouses_for_vendor, get_stock_by_warehouse,
select_nearest_warehouse with haversine distance calculation.

Checkout now routes each vendor fulfillment to the nearest warehouse
with stock, carrying warehouse_name and distance_km through the order
event to the vendor. Vendor Order and Vendor Fulfillment both gain
warehouse fields.

Stock events from vendors now carry warehouse context so the hub tracks
per-location inventory. Migration patch initializes existing Vendor Stock
rows as default warehouse entries.

